   "all_day": false,
   "description": "Bandswap is back again!\n\nRandomly draw names to form bands\u2014 randomly draw song suggestions to form your sets\u2014 play LIVE the next night!\n\n\u2014\u2014\n\nThis year our festivities have landed right smack dab in the middle of holiday time Don\u2019t cry, we\u2019ve sorted it out.\n\nSignups are open Dec 4th to 13th (link will be posted on our socials Dec 4th)\n\nWe\u2019ll meet to draw bandmates and read out everyone\u2019s song suggestions Dec 20th at Amigos.\n\nSongs will be drawn and distributed into TOP SECRET BANDSWAP BOXING DAY BOXES to be opened XMAS night and emailed to band captains! \u2014meaning you still get the patented Bandswap joy of having 24 hrs to learn your stuff.\n\nMusicians of any skill are encouraged to apply! You don\u2019t have to be a pro, you just have to know how to play an instrument and have a good time.\n\nAll proceeds donated to the Jill Mack Scholarship.",
